// Type DAG + interning (Phase 1). Authority: design_documents/Phase1_TODOs/type_dag_interning_phase0_kinds.md
// Logical TypeKey = { kind, a, b, c }; BST intern table keyed by "k,a,b,c,f".
// Seed-legal: named structs + List. Checker uses parse_type / intern_key.

